oris-trace 1
# One allocation per bucket boundary: sizes 1..8 share bucket 0, 9..16 bucket 1, and so
# on up to 249..256 in bucket 31; 257 is the first tree-path size. A sized free names the
# bucket directly (bucket_free_direct), a plain free recovers it from the page.
alloc h0 1
alloc h1 8
alloc h2 9
alloc h3 16
alloc h4 17
alloc h5 248
alloc h6 249
alloc h7 256
alloc h8 257
free_sized h0 1
free h1
free_sized h2 9
free h3
free_sized h4 17
free h5
free_sized h6 249
free h7
free_sized h8 257
purge
